### 3.6.13 — Akatz static context
All loop-invariant dependencies are packed **once before While Open** and carried through `value4`.

- no direct recursive-body link to Prepare Canvas / VGGT FOV / model loaders / CacheSession;
- tensors and models are references only — no clone/copy;
- FOV is persisted as a tiny scalar in the Orbit cache-session folder and restored after `UnifiedCachePrepare`, so the full context is not pinned downstream.

